flowchart LR
    Detect[Detect / report] --> Declare[Declare, classify, roles, timeline]
    Declare --> Stabilize[Protect people, tenants, money and accepted work]
    Stabilize --> Investigate[Facts, hypotheses, scoped evidence]
    Investigate --> Recover[Disable / fix / rollback / failover]
    Recover --> Verify{Task, integrity, SLO and backlog safe?}
    Verify -- No --> Stabilize
    Verify -- Yes --> Reconcile[Unknown outcomes, providers, devices, merchants]
    Reconcile --> Communicate[Resolve communication and handoff]
    Communicate --> Learn[Review, controls, tests, owners]

